[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11400.79, "timestamp": "03:10:00", "text": "里面有个漂亮女士"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11403.59, "timestamp": "03:10:03", "text": "一个盒子之类的东西，然后人们就来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11406.15, "timestamp": "03:10:06", "text": "请在此集合。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11409.349, "timestamp": "03:10:09", "text": "它叫什么名字？等等，这样走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11411.91, "timestamp": "03:10:11", "text": "对，就像叉子一样。是的，确实有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11415.83, "timestamp": "03:10:15", "text": "差不多就是这样。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11423.59, "timestamp": "03:10:23", "text": "你觉得那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11440.03, "timestamp": "03:10:40", "text": "我甚至还打算装个铃铛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11442.79, "timestamp": "03:10:42", "text": "找个地方，这样如果她睡着了，我们就可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11445.19, "timestamp": "03:10:45", "text": "叫醒她。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11456.15, "timestamp": "03:10:56", "text": "乔，你看到我们的基地了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11459.11, "timestamp": "03:10:59", "text": "我们的基地被摧毁了。"}]